{
  "@context": "../context.jsonld",
  "_source": "Advanced urban systems taxonomy for climate adaptation. Multi-tiered hierarchy mapping physical, ecological, and socio-economic urban subsystems.",
  "_usage": "urban_systems.systems_affected[].system_id and sector",
  "_sync_with": "None - conceptual taxonomy for classification",
  "_note": "This taxonomy enables precise classification of where a solution is deployed and what it protects. Supports interdependency analysis and critical bottleneck identification. v0.1.1: added informal_service_systems subsector under socioeconomic_health to capture service provision filled by informal actors where formal systems are absent — addresses IPCC AR6 Ch. 6 critique that ISO 37120 misses informal urban systems entirely.",
